bind Report Animal Abuse: Abuse Severity, Animal Species
bind Rescue Animal: Health, Age
bind Place in Foster Home: Capacity
bind Conduct Adoption Screening: Adoption Status
bind Process Donation: Amount
bind Approve Volunteer Application: Volunteer Background Check
